7... Nxe4 $2 { Grabs the pawn, expecting White to win it back slowly with Re1 or d4. } 8. Bd5 { Hits the knight on e4 and the knight on c6, with the rook on a8 behind it. One of them falls. [%cal Gd5e4,Gd5c6] } 8... Bb7 9. Bxe4 { White wins a piece for a pawn. } *
